<title>USA: TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $714,250</p>
<p>Advanta Championships tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2)</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat 2-Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>5-7 6-2</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat 6-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
